# PR titles

Org check **Validate PR Title**. Use this format in `gh pr create --title` and when renaming a PR. Do not use `fix:`, `feat:`, or Conventional Commits prefixes.

## Format

- With Jira: `<TICKET-ID>: <Short description>`
- Without Jira (chores only): `chore: <Short description>`

Ticket projects: `IGP`, `FPAY`, `FPTT`, `ISG`, `ITG`, `LP`, `SOL` (e.g. `FPTT-1315`).

Description: sentence case after the colon, no trailing period, keep it short.

```
# BAD
fix: disable npm provenance for private GitHub repo
feat: add button variant
FPTT-1315 add alerts
chore:Add org checks

# GOOD
LP-248: Add dynamic reset password URL support
FPTT-1315: Clear Dependabot alerts
SOL-12: Update solutions landing page
chore: Disable npm provenance for private GitHub repo
chore: Add organization-wide PR naming checks
```

If the work has a Jira key, always use the ticket form. Use `chore:` only when there is no ticket.
